w-required","geometryStatus":"draft","attribution":"Open Landmarks; contains © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL-1.0","references":[{"title":"File:San Francisco Ferry Building (cropped).jpg","author":"JaGa","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:San_Francisco_Ferry_Building_(cropped).jpg","sourceSha1":"e6411fcbf4390b3172f403d68d94d112834dccbe","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"exterior"},{"title":"File:California-06376 - Ferry Building (20450110740).jpg","author":"Dennis G. Jarvis","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:California-06376_-_Ferry_Building_(20450110740).jpg","sourceSha1":"9a218a7a26768e0b1ee4b51d0ab8594a68a3ddd3","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"exterior"}],"kind":"building","aliases":[],"authors":["Open Landmarks contributors"],"artisticLicense":"CC-BY-4.0","spatialDataLicense":"ODbL-1.0","licenseScope":"CC BY applies to original artistic contributions only; ODbL applies to OSM-derived spatial data. Reference photographs retain their own licenses.","assistance":"AI-assisted architectural interpretation and procedural recipe authoring; deterministic Python/Blender export. No photographic textures.","review":{"status":"pending","reviewer":null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["Mapped: OSM way558731934 v24 is the complete terminal footprint; original way24460886 v29 supplies16.1m main body. Clock-tower parts404449724,406710833–839 supply the actual nested plans and43.5/50.5/54.2/60.5/64.5/68.2/70/83.1m elevations. The narrow final83.1m part is retained as the flagstaff, not misread as the clock-face height. Every source version/date/tag is retained.","Resourced: individually inspected Commons San Francisco Ferry Building cropped (CC BY-SA4.0) shows symmetrical long arcades and the tower hierarchy; California06376 (CC BY-SA2.0) shows real open ground gallery arches and open belfry stages. Library of Congress item2013630363 records four22ft(6.7056m)clock dials and a245ft clock tower; mapped nested tiers end at70m plus slender flagstaff83.1m, so those source heights are retained rather than replacing the entire tower with a74.676m block.","Inferred: arcade depth2.1m, bay spacing, engaged upper pilasters, main-roof parapet and stepped cornices are authored from photos. Clock hands and12hour ticks are original texture-free geometry. Both LODs retain the same full plan, genuine ground arch passages, four clocks, open belfries, dome and flagstaff. No ferry pier or adjacent post office is included."],"source":{"url":"/objects/829a8044749bef7fe6afe9e8521cf3053d2fd7362563beb6b33c03b5827353eb/source.blend.gz","bytes":455809,"sha256":"829a8044749bef7fe6afe9e8521cf3053d2fd7362563beb6b33c03b5827353eb"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/d4337472b30677e79861c0fd1290089f2db975d9f160dfe8cdce16e81268802f/spatial-source.json","bytes":17576,"sha256":"d4337472b30677e79861c0fd1290089f2db975d9f160dfe8cdce16e81268802f"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/889b930d57e7d46559ba01316b8620faba27e3c69c610108b1ed79f7c91af279/preview.webp","bytes":9268,"sha256":"889b930d57e7d46559ba01316b8620faba27e3c69c610108b1ed79f7c91af279"},"previewDirection":[-1,0.5,0.7],"revision":"acc7e3283ed8c6053b6b065673973ff203d16bc4d0bd2981abaecb7ae42a5597","publicationRevision":"23edb737e6b830ec2fda0e7e9002ee65f8e2039c50ddf37bbcd5204b28eb52e4","bounds":[-122.3943231,37.7946819,-122.392536,37.7963941],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"7afc40cf0b82b7c3c054f287817be2a37e52192aa734f187f8b20ee3277187dd","url":"/materials/7afc40cf0b82b7c3c054f287817be2a37e52192aa734f187f8b20ee3277187dd.json"},"metadata":"/assets/ferry-building/23edb737e6b830ec2fda0e7e9002ee65f8e2039c50ddf37bbcd5204b28eb52e4/asset.json","validation":"/assets/ferry-building/23edb737e6b830ec2fda0e7e9002ee65f8e2039c50ddf37bbcd5204b28eb52e4/validation.json"}